{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_32100","headline":"上杜驸马 · 贾岛","name":"上杜驸马","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"玉山突兀压乾坤，出得朱门入戟门。\n妻是九重天子女，身爲一品令公孙。\n鸳鸯殿里参皇后，龙凤堂前贺至尊。\n今日澧阳非久驻，伫爲霖雨拜新恩。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"贾岛","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_32100.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_32100","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"七言律诗","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}